	(text "Improvements:\n- Additional blade connectors for USB OTG\n- Integration of rotary switch instead of reed switches\n- Reverse current blockage for 5V Boost\n- Need stepdown converter on rear batt pcb to stepdown 5v on usb to 3v\n- Need at least 10 blades?\n	- Batt1\n	- Batt2\n	- GND\n	- SDA\n	- SCL\n	- 3.3V\n	- D+\n	- D- \n	- On/off\n	- Mode\n"
